{"seq":3,"slug":"metricsql-single-vs-cluster","title":"MetricsQL 语义扩展与单机/集群版选型实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/grafana-mimir-victoriametrics-metrics-tsdb/victoriametrics-engine/metricsql-single-vs-cluster","wordCount":2269,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"metricsql-语义扩展与单机-集群版选型实操\">MetricsQL 语义扩展与单机/集群版选型实操</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-metricsql-是语义层-single-cluster-是部署层\">核心概念：MetricsQL 是语义层，single/cluster 是部署层</h2><p>VictoriaMetrics 把「查询语言」和「部署形态」当两个可独立决策的问题：前者是 MetricsQL——在 PromQL 之上补了一层隐式转换与语义修正；后者是 single-node 与 cluster 两条代码路径——共用同一份存储引擎（见同章 <a href=\"storage-engine-parts-mergetree\">存储引擎与 parts 合并树</a>），运维面却完全不同。截至 2026-10-07，最新稳定版为 <strong>v1.153.0</strong>（2026-09-28，见 <a href=\"https://github.com/VictoriaMetrics/VictoriaMetrics/releases\">Releases</a>），下文所有函数/flag 的版本锚点以此为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"裸选择器自动包裹-metricsql-与-promql-的第一处分叉\">裸选择器自动包裹：MetricsQL 与 PromQL 的第一处分叉</h2><p>PromQL 里 <code>foo{bar=&quot;baz&quot;}</code> 是合法的瞬时向量返回值；MetricsQL 里同样写它，引擎会<strong>在解析期自动改写成</strong> <code>default_rollup(foo{bar=&quot;baz&quot;})</code>。官方措辞是「Every series selector in MetricsQL must be wrapped into a rollup function」（<a href=\"https://docs.victoriametrics.com/victoriametrics/metricsql/\">MetricsQL 文档</a>）。这不是语法糖而是语义强制归一：MetricsQL 不存在「裸样本返回」状态，任何选择器最终必须落到某个 rollup 上。</p>\n<p>由此派生出一串「省略即合法」的写法，PromQL 里会直接报错：方括号窗口可省略（<code>rate(node_network_receive_bytes_total)</code> 合法）；默认窗口是 <code>step</code>（Grafana 的 <code>$__interval</code>，MetricsQL 记作 <code>1i</code>），但 <code>default_rollup</code> 与 <code>rate</code> 例外，默认窗口是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max(step,\\; scrape\\_interval)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——这解释了为什么 Grafana 里 step 小于抓取间隔时 <code>rate()</code> 仍返回非空；传给 rollup 的非选择器参数会被自动转成 subquery。<code>default_rollup</code> 值得单独记：它返回窗口内最后一个原始样本，且<strong>尊重 Prometheus staleness marker</strong>——这点与 <code>last_over_time</code> 不同。告警规则里区分「序列已消失」与「序列值为 0」时，这个差别是可观测的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"语法扩展清单-运算符-模板与面板落地价值\">语法扩展清单：运算符、模板与面板落地价值</h2><p>按「写 dashboard/告警规则时实际会用到」收敛，下面这组扩展均出自 MetricsQL 文档 &quot;MetricsQL features&quot; 段（<a href=\"https://docs.victoriametrics.com/victoriametrics/metricsql/\">MetricsQL 文档</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>写法</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>补空洞</td>\n<td><code>q1 default q2</code></td>\n<td>用 <code>q2</code> 值填 <code>q1</code> 缺口，聚合前对齐序列常用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交集过滤</td>\n<td><code>q1 if q2</code> / <code>q1 ifnot q2</code></td>\n<td><code>if</code> 保留 <code>q2</code> 存在处的值，<code>ifnot</code> 反之</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保留指标名</td>\n<td><code>rate(...) keep_metric_names</code></td>\n<td>默认函数丢指标名，多序列时有 <code>duplicate time series</code> 风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复用前缀</td>\n<td><code>WITH (p=&quot;long_prefix_&quot;)</code></td>\n<td>模板 + 字符串拼接，多行查询维护刚需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标签过滤扩展</td>\n<td><code>{env=&quot;prod&quot; or env=&quot;dev&quot;}</code>、<code>q == (C1, ..., CN)</code></td>\n<td>多 OR 过滤与数值集合匹配，PromQL 需多查询再 union</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批量复制标签</td>\n<td><code>... group_left(*) prefix &quot;ns_&quot;</code></td>\n<td><code>*</code> 复制全部标签，<code>prefix</code> 加前缀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>步长相对窗口</td>\n<td><code>rate(m[10i] offset 5i)</code></td>\n<td><code>Ni</code> 绑定 Grafana 当前 step，面板随缩放自适应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚合增强</td>\n<td><code>avg(q1, q2, q3)</code>、<code>sum(x) by (y) limit 3</code></td>\n<td>多参逐点聚合 + 输出限量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>面板场景中 <code>[Ni]</code> 与 <code>WITH</code> 最值得进规范：前者消除硬编码 <code>[5m]</code> 在多分辨率面板上的失真，后者让跨 20 行的告警表达式可维护。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rate-increase-语义差异与-prometheus-兼容逃生舱\">rate/increase 语义差异与 Prometheus 兼容逃生舱</h2><p>如果只记一条差异，应该记 <code>rate</code>/<code>increase</code> 的窗口取值。MetricsQL 会把<strong>窗口前最后一个原始样本算进来</strong>：设窗口为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t_0, t_n]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，窗口前最近样本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(t_{-1}, v_{-1})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">increase = v_{n} - v_{-1}, \\qquad rate = \\frac{increase}{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8234em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0225em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3365em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 为 lookbehind 窗口时长。后果有二：Prometheus 会忽略 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8234em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 到窗口内首个样本间的增量，MetricsQL 不会——低抓取频率下就是可见的数值差；且 MetricsQL <strong>不外推</strong>，不会出现 Prometheus 那种因外推产生的非整数计数器增量。需要逐位复现 Prometheus 结果时（如迁移后对齐历史告警），可用语义兼容的 <code>rate_prometheus</code>（自 <strong>v1.120.0</strong> 起）、<code>increase_prometheus</code>、<code>changes_prometheus</code>、<code>delta_prometheus</code>。其中 <code>delta</code> 差异值得单列：MetricsQL 的 <code>delta</code> 比较「窗口前最后一个样本」与「窗口内最后一个样本」，<code>delta_prometheus</code> 用窗口内首尾两个样本。</p>\n<p>另有几处有意为之的不兼容：MetricsQL <strong>丢弃输出的 NaN</strong>（<code>(-1)^0.5</code> 返回空），标量被当作无标签瞬时向量，部分不改变语义的函数（<code>min_over_time</code>、<code>round</code>）<strong>自动保留指标名</strong>。官方 FAQ 承认这是刻意为之——「MetricsQL provides better user experience than PromQL. It fixes a few annoying issues in PromQL」（<a href=\"https://docs.victoriametrics.com/victoriametrics/faq/\">FAQ</a>）。实践含义：Prometheus 背书的 Grafana 面板基本可直接复用，但两套系统做数值对账时必须显式选用 <code>*_prometheus</code> 变体或接受这批已知差异，否则会得到「迁移后指标对不上」的假警报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选型决策-能力天花板与推荐阈值\">选型决策：能力天花板与推荐阈值</h2><p>选型的第一性依据是官方 FAQ 给出的能力上限与建议（<a href=\"https://docs.victoriametrics.com/victoriametrics/faq/\">FAQ · scalability limits</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>single-node</th>\n<th>cluster</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>扩展方向</td>\n<td>仅垂直（CPU/RAM/磁盘）</td>\n<td>垂直 + 水平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实测上限（官方口径）</td>\n<td>最高 <strong>1 亿活跃序列</strong>、<strong>200 万样本/秒</strong></td>\n<td><strong>数十亿活跃序列</strong>、<strong>数亿样本/秒</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推荐摄入阈值</td>\n<td><strong>低于 100 万数据点/秒</strong></td>\n<td>超过该阈值，或下有两条诉求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原生多租户</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持（<code>accountID:projectID</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运维复杂度</td>\n<td>单进程，最低</td>\n<td>三类组件需分别扩缩容</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>官方 cluster 文档的单机阈值原文是「It is recommended to use the single-node version for ingestion rates lower than a million data points per second」，并建议「think twice before choosing the cluster version」（<a href=\"https://docs.victoriametrics.com/victoriametrics/cluster-victoriametrics/\">Cluster 文档</a>）。FAQ 把「该选集群」收敛为仅两类：<strong>需要原生多租户</strong>，或<strong>单机已扛不住当前负载</strong>。官博甚至专文《Don&#39;t choose VictoriaMetrics cluster unless you have to》劝退过早微服务化的团队（<a href=\"https://victoriametrics.com/blog/dont-default-to-microservices-you-will-thank-us-later/\">博客</a>）。</p>\n<p>决策链路如下，「多租户」与「容量」是两条并列触发线，任一命中才升级到集群：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[估算工作负载&lt;br/&gt;活跃序列数 + 样本/秒] --&gt; B{需要原生多租户?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[cluster&lt;br/&gt;accountID:projectID 隔离]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{摄入 &gt; 100 万数据点/秒&lt;br/&gt;或活跃序列 &gt; 1 亿?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[single-node&lt;br/&gt;垂直扩容]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F{已有 30+ 分片&lt;br/&gt;且资源可加?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[优先垂直扩容&lt;br/&gt;vmstorage 加 RAM/CPU]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| C&#10;    E --&gt; H[HA: 双副本 + 去重&lt;br/&gt;-dedup.minScrapeInterval]&#10;    C --&gt; I[vminsert 分片写入]&#10;    C --&gt; J[vmselect 查询 + 去重]&#10;    C --&gt; K[vmstorage 有状态&lt;br/&gt;建议 ≥10 节点]\">graph TD\n    A[估算工作负载&lt;br/&gt;活跃序列数 + 样本/秒] --&gt; B{需要原生多租户?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[cluster&lt;br/&gt;accountID:projectID 隔离]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{摄入 &gt; 100 万数据点/秒&lt;br/&gt;或活跃序列 &gt; 1 亿?}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[single-node&lt;br/&gt;垂直扩容]\n    D --&gt;|是| F{已有 30+ 分片&lt;br/&gt;且资源可加?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[优先垂直扩容&lt;br/&gt;vmstorage 加 RAM/CPU]\n    F --&gt;|否| C\n    E --&gt; H[HA: 双副本 + 去重&lt;br/&gt;-dedup.minScrapeInterval]\n    C --&gt; I[vminsert 分片写入]\n    C --&gt; J[vmselect 查询 + 去重]\n    C --&gt; K[vmstorage 有状态&lt;br/&gt;建议 ≥10 节点]</pre><h2 id=\"集群组件与容量规划实操\">集群组件与容量规划实操</h2><p>集群把职责拆成三类进程：<code>vminsert</code> 接收写入并按一致性哈希分片，<code>vmselect</code> 跨存储节点查询并去重，<code>vmstorage</code> 是有状态的数据持有者；<code>vmagent</code> 建议前置，负责压缩、批量转发与独立磁盘缓冲。关键数字可直接引用官方 &quot;Capacity planning&quot; 段（<a href=\"https://docs.victoriametrics.com/victoriametrics/cluster-victoriametrics/\">Cluster 文档 · Capacity planning</a>）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>分片数</strong>：从 <strong>20–30 个 <code>vmstorage</code> 分片</strong>起步，「Prefer running many small vmstorage nodes over a few big vmstorage nodes」，官方建议至少 10 个存储节点。</li>\n<li><strong><code>vminsert</code> 配比</strong>：约每 <strong>3–5 个 <code>vmstorage</code> 配 1 个 <code>vminsert</code></strong>；写 QPS 高时水平扩，否则垂直扩，<strong>每 vCPU 约 2 GiB RAM</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong><code>vmselect</code></strong>：数量按读负载定，<strong>至少预留 10 GiB 本地缓存磁盘</strong>；重查询延迟随其 CPU 核数改善。</li>\n<li><strong>资源余量</strong>：<strong>50% 空闲 RAM</strong>、<strong>50% 空闲 CPU</strong>、<code>-storageDataPath</code> 下<strong>至少 20% 空闲磁盘</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>复制因子</strong>：复制把开销放大最多 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 倍，集群至少需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2N-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个 <code>vmstorage</code>；官方更推荐依赖云厂商的复制持久盘。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>存储容量可用一次压测线性外推。官方例子：若一天生产负载占用 10 GB，则 <code>-retentionPeriod=100d</code> 至少需要</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>GB</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>TB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{100d} = S_{1d} \\times D = 10\\,\\text{GB} \\times 100 = 1\\,\\text{TB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">100</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GB</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TB</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>还要注意分区清理的瞬时峰值：每月末的最终去重会<strong>临时占用与上月数据等量的空间</strong>，所以 <code>-storage.minFreeDiskSpaceBytes</code> 应按「一个月内计划摄入的数据量」放大。这与分区生命周期直接相关，参见 <a href=\"compression-index-schema\">压缩、倒排索引与去重机制</a>。另一个陷阱：<strong>组件只在启动时读一次 CPU/内存上限</strong>来定缓存与并发上限，因此原地垂直扩容（如 VPA）不会生效，改完必须重启。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多租户边界-单机不支持-集群靠-32-位整数隔离\">多租户边界：单机不支持，集群靠 32 位整数隔离</h2><p>多租户是选型时最硬的分界线。<strong>单机版不支持原生多租户</strong>；要隔离只有两条路：按标签隔离（<code>{env=&quot;prod&quot;}</code>、<code>{team=&quot;platform&quot;}</code>）并用 <code>vmauth</code> 强制注入读过滤条件，或每租户跑一个单机实例再由路由层分发（<a href=\"https://docs.victoriametrics.com/victoriametrics/faq/\">FAQ · multitenancy</a>）。</p>\n<p>集群版的租户标识是 <strong>32 位整数</strong> <code>accountID:projectID</code>（缺省 projectID 为 <code>0</code>）；租户无需预建，<strong>第一个数据点写入时自动建立</strong>。<code>vminsert</code> 从 URL 路径 <code>/insert/&lt;accountID&gt;:&lt;projectID&gt;/...</code>、HTTP 头 <code>AccountID</code>/<code>ProjectID</code>、或混合租户端点 <code>/insert/multitenant/</code> 配合 <code>vm_account_id</code>/<code>vm_project_id</code> 标签三处取租户身份（标签在 relabel 后提取，<strong>转发给 <code>vmstorage</code> 前会被移除</strong>）。<code>vmselect</code> 走 <code>/select/&lt;accountID&gt;:&lt;projectID&gt;/prometheus/...</code>；跨租户查询必须用 <code>/select/multitenant/...</code>；URL 给了租户 ID 时<strong>请求头会被忽略</strong>（<a href=\"https://docs.victoriametrics.com/victoriametrics/cluster-victoriametrics/\">Cluster 文档 · Multitenancy</a>）。</p>\n<p>安全上有一条硬边界：<strong>multitenant 端点应仅对可信客户端开放</strong>，因为它们能跨租户读写。令牌、配额、计费等租户元数据不在 VictoriaMetrics 内部维护，官方预期交由 <code>vmauth</code>/<code>vmgateway</code> 在入口承担；VictoriaMetrics 自身只按租户暴露统计指标，按租户限额可用 <code>-storage.maxHourlySeries</code>。这套「边界内做隔离、边界外做认证」的分工，与 <a href=\"../mimir-architecture-scale/multitenancy-limits-scaleout\">Mimir 架构与横向扩展</a> 里讨论的多租户限流同源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结-迁移路径与落地顺序\">小结：迁移路径与落地顺序</h2><p>单机与集群的<strong>磁盘格式不同</strong>——不能把 <code>-storageDataPath</code> 目录直接搬到集群的 <code>vmstorage</code> 上。官方给了两条路径：其一，在旁边新起一个集群让两者<strong>并存</strong>，直到集群积累满新数据、旧数据超出 <code>vmsingle</code> 保留期，这条路径零迁移、零停机；其二，若必须真正搬迁历史数据，走 <code>vmctl</code> 的迁移流程。此外，启用复制后必须让 <code>vmselect</code> 与 <code>vmstorage</code> 都带上 <code>-dedup.minScrapeInterval=1ms</code>（VictoriaMetrics 时间戳精度为毫秒），否则副本样本不会在查询期被正确去重（<a href=\"https://docs.victoriametrics.com/victoriametrics/cluster-victoriametrics/\">Cluster 文档</a>）。</p>\n<p>可执行的落地顺序：先用 single-node + <code>vmagent</code> 磁盘缓冲跑生产负载，开双副本 HA 并把 <code>-dedup.minScrapeInterval</code> 设成抓取间隔；用官方 Grafana 面板观察活跃序列数与资源曲线；只有当「出现真实多租户需求」或「摄入逼近 100 万数据点/秒 / 活跃序列逼近 1 亿」时，才按 20–30 分片起步搭集群，并预留 50% RAM/CPU 与 20% 以上磁盘余量。版本上锁定 <strong>v1.153.0</strong>（2026-09-28）这类近期稳定 tag，把 <code>rate_prometheus</code> 的可用性（≥ v1.120.0）纳入升级检查项，即可在语义与规模两条线上都不留盲区。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"MetricsQL 语义扩展与单机/集群版选型实操","id":"metricsql-语义扩展与单机-集群版选型实操"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：MetricsQL 是语义层，single/cluster 是部署层","id":"核心概念-metricsql-是语义层-single-cluster-是部署层"},{"level":2,"text":"裸选择器自动包裹：MetricsQL 与 PromQL 的第一处分叉","id":"裸选择器自动包裹-metricsql-与-promql-的第一处分叉"},{"level":2,"text":"语法扩展清单：运算符、模板与面板落地价值","id":"语法扩展清单-运算符-模板与面板落地价值"},{"level":2,"text":"rate/increase 语义差异与 Prometheus 兼容逃生舱","id":"rate-increase-语义差异与-prometheus-兼容逃生舱"},{"level":2,"text":"选型决策：能力天花板与推荐阈值","id":"选型决策-能力天花板与推荐阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"集群组件与容量规划实操","id":"集群组件与容量规划实操"},{"level":2,"text":"多租户边界：单机不支持，集群靠 32 位整数隔离","id":"多租户边界-单机不支持-集群靠-32-位整数隔离"},{"level":2,"text":"小结：迁移路径与落地顺序","id":"小结-迁移路径与落地顺序"}],"prev":{"title":"高压缩率编码、倒排索引与去重机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/grafana-mimir-victoriametrics-metrics-tsdb/victoriametrics-engine/compression-index-schema"},"next":{"title":"PromQL 求值模型与查询执行路径（select/lookup/merge）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/grafana-mimir-victoriametrics-metrics-tsdb/operations-query-promql/promql-evaluation-engine"}}